                            "steamid": "76561198230164448",
                            "num_reviews": 115,
                            "playtime_forever": 385,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 385,
                            "playtime_at_review": 385,
                            "last_played": 1793447985
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a great depiction of how cruel and pointless war is, and how people get dragged into it for all the wrong reasons. The game was good, captivating and beautiful to look at. The VA in this game were also great both from the German and Canadian side, There is not much gameplay to be experienced here as it is a walking simulator, but making a war game where you either take photographs or talk to people is a unique concept and one that is executed well.\r\n\r\nHell you even get to play as a cat.\r\n\r\nNever enlist.",
